  "title": "Law360 speaks with Christopher Bogart about UK industry regulation",
  "summary": "Burford CEO Christopher Bogart recently spoke with reporters about regulation in the UK, saying that \"he didn't have 'any difficulty at all with people looking at the industry,'\" but that \"'hyperregulation'\" would be \"'a mistake,' particularly in relation to large-scale commercial litigation.\"",
